    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d830">

                <pb facs="0825" n="659" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg659"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 711.5914/245</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to Senator Stone </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Department of State</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1916-08-22">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">August 22, 1916</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">My dear Senator Stone</hi>: I have received your
                    memorandum requesting further information in regard to the following articles of
                    the proposed treaty with Denmark ceding to the United States the Danish West
                    India Islands: Article 2, Article 3, Article 6, Article 8, Clause 3, Article 9,
                    and Article 10.</p>
                <p>In reply, I have had prepared and enclose herewith a summary memorandum which, I
                    believe, contains the information that you desire. If I can be of further
                    assistance to you or can furnish you with any copies of the original documents
                    from which the enclosed memorandum was compiled, I shall, as you know, be very
                    glad to do so.</p>
                <p>I am [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Robert Lansing</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>


                <xi:include href="d830-a1.xml" xpointer="d830-a1"/>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
